### ===================================
### Word Star List API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/star/list
### ===================================

### Create Word Star List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/save
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

listName=My Vocabulary&remark=Daily words to review

###

### Get Current User's Word Star Lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/getCurrentUserList
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Star List by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/1

###

### Update Word Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/updateById
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&listName=Updated Vocabulary&remark=Updated remark&sort=1

###

### Get Word Star List Items (Paginated)
# Path: /getListItems/{size}/{current}/{listId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/getListItems/20/0/1

###

### Get List Items - Page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/getListItems/20/1/1

###

### Add Word to Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/putWordStarList?wordId=1&listId=1

###

### Add Another Word to Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/putWordStarList?wordId=2&listId=1

###

### Find All Word IDs in List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/findAllWordId/1

###

### Remove Word from Star List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/removeWordStarList?wordId=1&listId=1

###

### Delete Word Star List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/star/list/del/1
